The `Cache` class is used to manage the cache of documents. It includes methods for putting, getting, and clearing cached documents, as well as an expiration time that determines how long a document can be stored in the cache before it is evicted. The `expirationTime` field is set to 1 minute by default, but it can be adjusted based on the needs of the application.

