The code also includes performance optimizations such as using a fixed-size buffer for reading lines from the CSV file, and using a single allocation for all Entry structures instead of allocating memory for each structure individually. Additionally, the code is designed to be easily extensible to support additional data sources or parsing rules without modifying core logic by providing a flexible interface for custom parsing rules.']

