// Function to provide a reporting mechanism to track memory usage statistics, including total allocated memory, free memory, and memory pool utilization. This should be done efficiently, minimizing overhead, but also allowing for dynamic toggling based on application needs. Consider using lightweight telemetry solutions to achieve this balance.
void report_memory_usage(struct record* records, size_t num_keys) {
    // Validate input
